Iridium AMBE vocoder codec
Vendored from: https://gitea.osmocom.org/satellite/osmo-ir77
Upstream commit: 6f7b0702a6cd (2017-12-02), codec/ directory

The files here are unmodified copies of upstream. Only compiled when
iridium-sniffer is configured with -DENABLE_VOICE=ON.

